| [Mistral Medium 3.5](https://docs.mistral.ai/models/mistral-medium-3-5-26-04) - `mistral-medium-latest` | [Devstral Small 2](https://docs.mistral.ai/models/devstral-small-2-25-12) - `devstral-small-latest` |[Magistral Small 1.2](https://docs.mistral.ai/models/magistral-small-1-2-25-09) - `magistral-small-latest`        |
